*Purpose:*
     defines a package (Only relevant in very special situations).

*Example:*
            package Test;
            int i=3; exportto(Test,i);
            Test::i+2;
          ==> 5
            i;
          ==>    ? `i` is undefined
          ==>    ? error occurred in or before ./examples/package_declarations.sing lin\
             e 4: `  i;`
            listvar();
            listvar(Test);
          ==> // Test                           [0]  package Test (N)
          ==> // ::i                            [0]  int 3
            package dummy = Test;
            kill Test;
            listvar(dummy);
          ==> // dummy                          [0]  package dummy (N)
          ==> // ::i                            [0]  int 3


