4.19.1 resolution declarations
------------------------------

*Syntax:*
     `resolution' name `=' resolution_expression `;'

*Purpose:*
     defines a resolution.

*Default:*
     none

*Example:*
            ring R;
            ideal i=z2,x;
            resolution re=res(i,0);
            re;
          ==>  1      2      1
          ==> R <--  R <--  R
          ==>
          ==> 0      1      2
          ==>
            betti(re);
          ==> 1,1,0,
          ==> 0,1,1
            list l = re;
            l;
          ==> [1]:
          ==>    _[1]=x
          ==>    _[2]=z2
          ==> [2]:
          ==>    _[1]=-z2*gen(1)+x*gen(2)
          ==> [3]:
          ==>    _[1]=0


