5.1.1 align
-----------

`*Syntax:*'
     `align (' vector_expression, int_expression `)'
     `align (' module_expression, int_expression `)'

`*Type:*'
     type of the first argument

`*Purpose:*'
     maps module generators `gen(i)' to `gen(i+s)' for all i.

`*Example:*'
            ring r=0,(x,y,z),(c,dp);
            align([1,2,3],3);
          ==> [0,0,0,1,2,3]
            align([0,0,1,2,3],-1);
          ==> [0,1,2,3]
            align(freemodule(2),1);
          ==> _[1]=[0,1]
          ==> _[2]=[0,0,1]


