5.2.2 break
-----------

`*Syntax:*'
     `break;'

`*Purpose:*'
     leaves the innermost `for' or `while' block.

`*Example:*'
          while (1)
          {
            ...
            if ( ... )
            {
              break; // leave the while block
            }
          }

