`*Purpose:*'
     executes true_block if the boolean condition is true. If the `if'
     statement is followed by an `else' statement and the boolean
     condition is false, then false_block is executed.

`*Example:*'
          int i = 9;
          matrix m[i][i];
          if (i > 5 and typeof(m) == "matrix")
          {
            m[i][i] = i;
          }

