7.5.5.26 poly2list
..................

Procedure from library `dmodapp.lib' (*note dmodapp_lib::).

*Usage:*
     poly2list(f); f a poly

*Return:*
     list of exponents and corresponding terms of f

*Purpose:*
     converts a poly to a list of pairs consisting of intvecs (1st
     entry)
     and polys (2nd entry), where the i-th pair contains the exponent
     of the
     i-th term of f and the i-th term (with coefficient) itself.

