Procedure from library `ncrat.lib' (*note ncrat_lib::).

*Usage:*
     list pencil = ncrepPencilGet(r, vars);

*Return:*
     pencil = list(vars, matrices),
     where vars = list(1, x1, ..., xg) are the variables
     occurring in r and matrices = (Q0, ..., Qg) is a list of matrices
     such that
     r.mat = Q0 * x0 + ... + Qg * xg
     with x0 = 1

