B.2.9 Pseudo ordering L
-----------------------

L(max_exponent) is not an ordering but sets the maximal allowed exponent
for polynomial in this ring. The default is 32767.  The current value
for a ring is reflected in the attribute "maxExp".  This attribute is
also set (and acknowledged) for the list constructed by `ringlist' and
the construction of a ring from such a list.


