D.2.4.25 DifConsLCSets
......................

Procedure from library `grobcov.lib' (*note grobcov_lib::).

*Return:*
     A list of locally closed sets equivalent to the difference S= A ""
     B.  Lc=[ [1][p1,q1]] [[2][p2,q2]]..],
