*Usage:*
     randomid(id[,k,b]); id ideal/module, b,k integers

*Return:*
     ideal/module having k generators which are random linear
     combinations of generators of id with coefficients in the interval
     [-b,b] (default: b=30000, k=size(id))

*Note_*
