D.2.12.13 ringweights
.....................

Procedure from library `ring.lib' (*note ring_lib::).

*Usage:*
     ringweights(P); P=name of an existing ring (true name, not a
     string)

*Return:*
     intvec consisting of the weights of the variables of P, as they
