D.3.1.2 concat
..............

Procedure from library `matrix.lib' (*note matrix_lib::).

*Usage:*
     concat(A1,A2,..); A1,A2,... matrices

*Return:*
     matrix, concatenation of A1,A2,.... Number of rows of result matrix
