D.4.3.2 assPrimes
.................

Procedure from library `assprimeszerodim.lib' (*note
assprimeszerodim_lib::).

*Assume:*
     I is zero-dimensional over Q[variables]

*Return:*
     a list of the associated primes of I

*Note_*
     A final test is applied to the result if exactness != 0 (default),
     otherwise no final test is done.

*Example:*
     LIB "assprimeszerodim.lib";
     ring R = 0,(a,b,c,d,e,f),dp;
     ideal I =
     2fb+2ec+d2+a2+a,
     2fc+2ed+2ba+b,
