D.5.8 numerAlg_lib
------------------

Todos/Issues:
   * does not follow the naming convention

   * syntax errors in examples

   * no test suite

*Library:*
     NumerAlg.lib

*Purpose:*
     Numerical Algebraic Algorithm

*Overview:*
     The library contains procedures to
     test the inclusion, the equality of two ideals defined by
     polynomial systems, compute the degree of a pure i-dimensional
     component of an algebraic variety defined by a polynomial system,
     compute the local dimension of an algebraic variety defined by a
     polynomial system at a point computed as an approximate value. The
     use of the library requires to install Bertini
     (http://www.nd.edu/~sommese/bertini).

*Author:*
     Shawki AlRashed, rashed@mathematik.uni-kl.de; sh.shawki@yahoo.de


*Procedures:*

* Menu:

* Incl:: test if I contains J
* Equal:: test if I equals to J
