D.5.10.3 matrixLog
..................

Procedure from library `orbitparam.lib' (*note orbitparam_lib::).

*Usage:*
     matrixLog(A); A matrix.

*Assume:*
     A-E is a nilpotent n x n matrix.
     If the characteristic p of the ground field is positive, then n
     has to be smaller than p.

*Return:*
     matrix, log(A)

*Theory:*
     We compute the power series, which terminates since A-E is
     nilpotent.

*Example:*
