D.5.11.6 mapToRatNormCurve
..........................

Procedure from library `paraplanecurves.lib' (*note
paraplanecurves_lib::).

*Usage:*
     mapToRatNormCurve(f, AI); f polynomial, AI ideal

*Assume:*
     The polynomial f is homogeneous in three variables and absolutely
     irreducible.
     The plane curve C defined by f is rational.
     The ideal AI is the adjoint ideal of C.

