D.5.15.10 CenterBO
..................

Procedure from library `resolve.lib' (*note resolve_lib::).

*Usage:*
     CenterBO(BO);
     BO = basic object, a list: ideal W,
     ideal J,
     intvec b,
     list Ex,
     ideal ab,
     intvec v,
     intvec w,
     matrix M

*Assume:*
     R = basering, a polynomial ring, W an ideal of R,
