D.6.3.8 arnoldMilnorCode
........................

Procedure from library `arnoldclassify.lib' (*note
arnoldclassify_lib::).

*Usage:*
     arnoldMilnorCode(f[,e]); f poly, e int

*Assume:*
     basering is local, f has isolated critical point at 0

*Compute:*
     Milnor code of f consisting of the numbers of successive
     repetitions of coefficients of the 2nd Hilbert series of
     basering/(jacob(f)^e), see [Bac01].

*Return:*
     Milnor code of f as intvec where e=1 by default

*Example:*
     LIB "arnoldclassify.lib";
     ring r=0,(x,y,z),ds;
     poly f=x2y+y3+z2;
     arnoldMilnorCode(f);
     ==> 1,1,1
     arnoldMilnorCode(f,2);
     ==> 1,1,2,1
     // a big second argument may result in memory overflow


