D.6.23.3 signatureNemethi
.........................

Procedure from library `surfacesignature.lib' (*note
surfacesignature_lib::).

*Usage:*
     signatureNemethi(N,f); N = integer, f = reduced poly in 2
     variables, # empty or 1,2,3
     - if #[1] = 1 then resolution of singularity is used
     - if #[1] = 2 then spectral pairs are used
     - if # is empty then both upper variants are used in parallel and
     the
     fastest returns the result

