D.7.1.36 image_of_variety
.........................

Procedure from library `finvar.lib' (*note finvar_lib::).

*Usage:*
     image_of_variety(I,F);
     I: an arbitrary <ideal>,
     F: a 1xm <matrix> defining an invariant ring of some matrix group

*Return:*
