D.10.2.16 vanishId
..................

Procedure from library `decodegb.lib' (*note decodegb_lib::).

*Usage:*
     vanishId (points); point is a list of matrices
     'points' is a list of points for which the vanishing ideal is to be
     constructed

*Return:*
