*Library:*
     aksaka.lib

*Purpose:*
     Procedures for primality testing after Agrawal, Saxena, Kayal

*Authors:*
     Christoph Mang

*Overview:*
     Algorithms for primality testing in polynomial time based on the
     ideas of Agrawal, Saxena and Kayal.


*Procedures:*

* Menu:

