D.12.3.7 gcddivisor
...................

Procedure from library `hyperel.lib' (*note hyperel_lib::).

*Usage:*
     gcddivisor(p,q);

*Return:*
     list P

*Note_*
     gcd of two divisors

*Example:*
     LIB "hyperel.lib";
     ring R=7,x,dp;
     // hyperelliptic curve y^2 + h*y = f
     poly h=x;
     poly f=x5+5x4+6x2+x+3;
     // two divisors
     list p=list(-1,-3,1),list(1,1,2);
     list q=list(1,1,1),list(2,2,1);
     gcddivisor(p,q);
     ==> [1]:
     ==>    [1]:
     ==>       1
     ==>    [2]:
     ==>       1
     ==>    [3]:
     ==>       1


