     ==> [2]:
     ==>    -25x-332
     ==> [3]:
     ==>    -16x2+42x-24
     ==> [4]:
     ==>    4x3-20x+73/2
     ==> [5]:
     ==>    5x4-4x3+1
     ==> [6]:
     ==>    x5-x4+x-3/2

