D.13.2.50 isCompatible
......................

Procedure from library `gfan.lib' (*note gfan_lib::).

*Usage:*
     isCompatible(f,c); f fan, c cone

*Return:*
     1 if f and c live in the same ambient space and
     if the intersection of c with any cone of f is a face of each; 0
     otherwise

*Example:*
     LIB "gfan.lib";
     fan f=emptyFan(3);
     intmat M1[3][3]=
     1,0,0,
     0,1,0,
     0,0,1;
     cone c1=coneViaPoints(M1);
     isCompatible(f,c1);
     ==> 1
     insertCone(f,c1);
     intmat M2[3][3]=
     1,1,1,
     1,0,0,
     0,1,0;
     cone c2=coneViaPoints(M2);
     isCompatible(f,c2);
     ==> 0
     intmat M3[3][3]=
     1,0,0,
     0,1,0,
     0,0,-1;
     cone c3=coneViaPoints(M3);
     isCompatible(f,c3);
     ==> 1


