Procedure from library `gitfan.lib' (*note gitfan_lib::).

*Usage:*
     isAface(a,gam0); a: ideal, gam0:intvec

*Purpose:*
     Checks whether gam0 is an a-face w.r.t. the ideal a.

*Return:*
     int

*Example:*
     LIB "gitfan.lib";
     ring R = 0,(T(1..4)),dp;
     ideal I = T(1)*T(2)-T(4);
     intvec w = 1,4;
     intvec v = 1,2,4;
     isAface(I,w); // should be 0
     ==> 0
     isAface(I,v); // should be 1
     ==> 1


