*Usage:*
     afaces(a [,L]); a: ideal, L: list of intvecs

*Purpose:*
     Returns a list of all a-faces (considered as intvecs of 0 and 1,
     where the i-th entry is 1 if the cone has the i-th unit basis
     vector as a generator), if L is specified only the faces of the
