     arrangement, which is equal to the second kind Poincare-Series of
     the Orlik-Solomon Algebra.

*Example:*
     LIB "arr.lib";
     ring R = 0,(x,y,z,u,v),dp;
     arr A = arrBraid(5);
     intvec v = arrPoincare(A);
     (1+x)*(1+2x)*(1+3x)*(1+4x);
     ==> 24x4+50x3+35x2+10x+1
     v;
     ==> 1,10,35,50,24

