D.15.1.18 exceptionalHypersurface
.................................

Procedure from library `arnold.lib' (*note arnold_lib::).

*Usage:*
     exceptionalHypersurface(N); N NormalForm of which the field
     N.exceptionalHypersurface is filled using
     @ref(determineNormalForm) and using
     @ref(determineExceptionalHypersurface)

*Return:*
     N.exceptionalHypersurface

*Example:*
