D.15.2.2 autGradAlg
...................

Procedure from library `autgradalg.lib' (*note autgradalg_lib::).

*Usage:*
     autGradAlg(I, TOR); I is an ideal, TOR is an optional list of
     integers representing the torsion part of the grading group.

*Assume:*
     minimally presented, degrees of the generators of I
     are the minimal degrees, basering multigraded pointedly, I_w = 0
     for all w = deg(var(i))

*Return:*
     a ring. Also exports an ideal Jexported and a list stabExported.

