        2
     ==> , given by a matrix, with degrees:
     ==>       ...1 ...2 .....
     ==>       ---- ---- +....
     ==>    1 :   1    - |...1
     ==>    1 :   1    - |...2
     ==>    5 :   -    - |...3
     ==>  -10 :   -    - |...4
     ==>   15 :   -    - |...5
     ==>    1 :   -    1 |...6
     ==>    1 :   -    1 |...7
