D.15.7.31 mappingcone3
......................

Procedure from library `gradedModules.lib' (*note gradedModules_lib::).

*Usage:*
     mappingcone3(A,B), graded objects A and B (matrices defining maps)

*Return:*
     chain complex (as a list)

*Purpose:*
     construct a free resolution of the cokernel of a random map
     between M=coker(A), and N=coker(B)

*Example:*
     LIB "gradedModules.lib";
