     prec, int k Iu the likelihood ideal, H the (modified) Hessian of
     the considered algebraic statistical model, prec the precision
     with which to compute the maximum likelihood estimates

*Return:*
     ring: a complex ring R in which you can find the following two
     lists: - MPOINTS, points in which the loglikelihood function has a
     local maximum, and - LHESSIANS, the (modified) Hessians at those
