D.15.13.10 isGroupHomomorphism
..............................

Procedure from library `multigrading.lib' (*note multigrading_lib::).

*Usage:*
     isGoupHomomorphism(L1,L2,A); L1 and L2 are groups, A is an integer
     matrix

