D.15.13.47 gradiator
....................

Procedure from library `multigrading.lib' (*note multigrading_lib::).

*Purpose:*
     coarsens the grading of the basering until the polynom or ideal h
     becomes homogeneous.

*Example:*
     LIB "multigrading.lib";
     ring r = 0,(x,y,z),dp;
     intmat g[2][3] = 1,0,1,0,1,1;
     intmat l[2][1] = 3,0;
     setBaseMultigrading(g,l);
     getLattice();
     ==> 3,0
     ideal i = -y5+x4,
     y6+xz,
     x2y;
     gradiator(i);
     ==> 1
     getLattice();
     ==> 3,4,2,
     ==> 0,-5,-5
     isHomogeneous(i);
     ==> 1


