D.15.16 puiseuxexpansions_lib
-----------------------------

*Library:*
     puiseuxexpansion.lib

*Purpose:*
     Puiseux expansions over algebraic extensions

*Authors:*
     J. Boehm, j.boehm at mx.uni-saarland.de
     W. Decker, decker at mathematik.uni-kl.de
     S. Laplagne, slaplagn at dm.uba.ar
     G. Pfister, seelisch at mathematik.uni-kl.de

*Overview:*
     This library implements the Newton-Puiseux algorithm to compute
     Puiseux expansions and provides a class and procedures to work
     with Puiseux expansions in K[X][Y], where K is the field Q of
     rational numbers or an algebraic extension of Q.


*Procedures:*

* Menu:

* puiseuxList:: Computes the Puiseux expansion of PP at X = 0
* makePuiseux:: Creates a Puiseux element
* makePuiseuxFromPoly:: Converts a polynomail to Puiseux data type
* printPuiseux:: Prints information for Puiseux elements
* puiseux:: Computes the Puiseux expansions of f


