D.15.22 stanleyreisner_lib
--------------------------

*Library:*
     stanleyreisner.lib

*Purpose:*
     Deformations of Stanley-Reiser ideals

*Authors:*

*Overview:*
     Firstly, we implement the graded pieces has certain degree of
     cotangent modules T1 and T2 for a general Stanley-Reiser ring. And
     the graded pieces of homomorphisms are represented by lists of
     integers.

*Types:*
     Homomorphism class of homomorphisms


*Procedures:*

* Menu:

* T1:: compute first order deformations
* T2:: compute second order deformations
* makeQPoly:: create a QPoly
* fPiece:: create a FirstOrderDeformation
* sPiece:: create a SecondOrderDeformation
* makeLinks:: create a FirstOrderDeformation of the links


