D.15.29.2 changeCoordinates
...........................

Procedure from library `VecField.lib' (*note VecField_lib::).

*Usage:*
     changeCoordinates(vecField V, map psi), where psi is an algebra
     morphism k[x1,...,xn]->k[y1,...,ym] expressing the new basis in
     terms of the old.

*Return:*
     A new vecfield in the new coordinates.

*Note_*
     the coordinate change necessitates inverting psi.
     The inversion will be correct up to the precision of V.

*Example:*
     LIB "VecField.lib";
