D.15.29.10 invertAlgebraMorphism
................................

Procedure from library `VecField.lib' (*note VecField_lib::).

*Usage:*
     invertAlgebraMorphism(map p,int n), where p is an algebra morphism
     k[x1,...,xn]->k[y1,...,ym],
     or invertAlgebraMorphism(ideal p,int n) if you represent the map
     as an ideal

*Return:*
     the inverse of p mod (maxideal)^n.
