5.1 News and changes
====================

NEWS in SINGULAR 4.4.1
**********************

News for version 4.4.1
======================

New libraries:
   * `arnold.lib': Classification of isolated singularities with a
     nondegenerate Newton Boundary (*note arnold_lib::)

   * `modprimdec.lib': primary decompisition by modular methods (*note
     modprimdec_lib::)

   * `modquotient.lib': ideal quotient and saturation by modular
     methods (*note modquotient_lib::)

   * `sagbiNormaliz.lib': interface for the computation of Sagbi bases
     (*note sagbiNormaliz_lib::)

   * `transformation.lib': The image of a transformation given up to a
     specified degree (*note transformation_lib::)

Changed libraries:
   * `polyclass.lib': extended (*note polyclass_lib::)

   * `primdec.lib': choice of random values, irreducibility test (*note
     primdec_lib::)

Changes in the kernel/build system:
   * use new algorithm for weighted Hilbert function *note hilb::

   * use new algorithm for *note std:: in the case of ordering `ds/Ds'
         and zero dimensional ideal over `QQ'       (can be switched
     off by `option(pure_gb;')

   * use new algorithm for *note std:: in the case of a block ordering
         and ideal over `QQ'       (can be switched off by
     `option(pure_gb;')

   * changed reduction routine for local orderings

News for version 4-4-0
======================

New libraries:
   * `modfinduni.lib': parallel computation of finduni (*note
     modfinduni_lib:: *note finduni::)

   * `sagbiNormaliz.lib': computation of Sagbi bases via normaliz
     (*note sagbiNormaliz_lib::)

   * `stdmodule.lib': Compute Standard Bases of submodule of free module
     over polynomial subalgebra (*note stdmodule_lib::)

   * `tropicalEllipticCovers.lib': Gromov-Witten numbers of tropical
     elliptic curves and their covers (*note
     tropicalEllipticCovers_lib::)

Changed libraries:
   * `normal.lib': optimized, integrated `locnorma.lib' and
     `modnormal.lib' (*note normal_lib::)

   * `normaliz.lib': update to normaliz 3.10 (*note normaliz_lib::)

   * `hess.lib': fixes (*note hess_lib::)

   * `sheafcoh.lib': new routines *note sheafCohBGGregul::, *note
     sheafCohBGGregul_w::, *note sheafCoh_w::, (*note sheafcoh_lib::)

   * `sheafcoh.lib': display of the tables is moved to *note
     displayCohom:: (*note sheafcoh_lib::)

   * `elim.lib': rename `sat' to `sat_with_exp', `sat' now return the
     saturation i9deal (only).

   * `primdec.lib': fixed a bug in absolute primary decomposition
     (*note primdec_lib::)

New type:
   * `bigintvec': *note bigintvec::

New commands:
   * new command *note prune_map::

   * new command *note mres_map::

New/renamed monomial orderings:

To avoid confusion (with the degree reverse lexicographic ordering) the
orderings `rp' and `rs' are renamed:
   * renamed orderings `rp' -> `ip' `rs' -> `is'

   * new ordering `Ip'

Changes in the kernel/build system:
   * new algorithm for *note std:: in the case of ordering `ds'
     and zero dimensional ideal over `QQ'

   * new algorithm for lift function (*note lift::)

   * mstd for local rings (*note mstd::)

   * use the new Hilbert function algorithm for *note hilb::.
     (Different output format/ different return type)

   * renamed orderings `ringorder_rp' -> `ringorder_ip' `ringorder_rs'
     -> `ringorder_is'

   * new ordering `ringorder_Ip'

   * changes for FLINT 3.0.x/3.1.x

